<title>USA: Value Line sets $15.00 per share dividend.</title>
<headline>Value Line sets $15.00 per share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Value Line Inc said Tuesday it declared an extraordinary dividend of $15.00 per share payable January 2, 1997, to all record holders of Common Stock as of the close of business December 26, 1996.</p>
</text>
